        { "target", name = "Sanath Lim-yo" },
        { "goto", x = 29.25, y = 40.21, zone = "1447" },
        { "accept", quest = 8251, text = "Accept Magic Dust (|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Archmage Xylem|r, in the tower)" },
        { "target", name = "Archmage Xylem" },
      },
      { only = "Mage", source = "polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_LOOT_Glittering Dust|r" },
        { "text", text = "The blood elves hold the Thalassian Base Camp on the hills of north-eastern Azshara. Blood Elf Surveyors (51-52, Fire Nova up close) and Reclaimers (52-53, Fireball, and they heal and Renew each other) each drop the dust about one time in four; they spot you from far off, so pull at the edges. They come back after 5 1/2 minutes." },
        { "goto", x = 55.46, y = 29.5, zone = "1447" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 8251, text = "Glittering Dust: 10" },
        { "mob", name = "Blood Elf Surveyor" },
        { "mob", name = "Blood Elf Reclaimer" },
      },
      { only = "Mage", source = "polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Archmage Xylem|r" },
        { "text", text = "Back to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sanath Lim-yo|r, who teleports you up to the tower." },
        { "goto", x = 29.25, y = 40.21, zone = "1447" },
        { "turnin", quest = 8251, text = "Turn in Magic Dust" },
        { "target", name = "Archmage Xylem" },
        { "goto", x = 29.25, y = 40.21, zone = "1447" },
        { "accept", quest = 8252, text = "Accept The Siren's Coral" },
        { "target", name = "Archmage Xylem" },
      },
      { only = "Mage", source = "polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_LOOT_Enchanted Coral|r" },
        { "text", text = "The Spitelash Sirens (level 50-52) walk the ruins and beaches around the Ruins of Eldarath and the bay east of Valormok, often three together, and a few stand inside the Temple of Zin-Malor; each drops a coral about one time in four. The Spitelash Screamers look almost the same but never drop it. Killing the other naga there makes more Sirens appear in their spots. |cOXP_ENEMY_Lingering Highborne|r ghosts wander the ruins: watch your back." },
        { "goto", x = 36.33, y = 48.02, zone = "1447" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 8252, text = "Enchanted Coral: 6 (|cOXP_LOOT_Enchanted Coral|r: |cOXP_ENEMY_Spitelash Siren|r)" },
        { "mob", name = "Spitelash Siren" },
      },
      { only = "Mage", source = "polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Archmage Xylem|r again" },
        { "text", text = "Back to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sanath Lim-yo|r and up to the tower." },
        { "goto", x = 29.25, y = 40.21, zone = "1447" },
        { "turnin", quest = 8252, text = "Turn in The Siren's Coral" },
        { "target", name = "Archmage Xylem" },
        { "goto", x = 29.25, y = 40.21, zone = "1447" },
        { "accept", quest = 8253, text = "Accept Destroy Morphaz" },
        { "target", name = "Archmage Xylem" },
      },
      { only = "Mage", source = "polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz",
        { "text", text = "Morphaz" },
        { "text", text = "The Temple of Atal'Hakkar, the Sunken Temple, lies in the Pool of Tears: climb the steps into the sunken building, swim down through it and follow the passage down to the portal. A group of five, level 50-54. Morphaz is not waiting when you arrive. First kill the six troll guardians (elites of 50-52) on the platforms around the upper ring; that opens the way down (the left-hand ramp from the entrance) to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Jammal'an the Prophet|r and |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ogom the Wretched|r in the Pit of Sacrifice. Once Jammal'an dies, two green drakes, Weaver and Dreamscythe, come out and patrol the pit: pull them one at a time. When both are dead, Morphaz (level 52 elite, Acid Breath and Wing Flap) and Hazzas appear together and cannot be split, so fight both. The shard always drops. Hunters, Priests and Rogues of 50 need Morphaz too: a group of them shares one clear." },
        { "goto", x = 69.9, y = 53.6, zone = "1435" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 8253, text = "Arcane Shard: 1 (|cOXP_LOOT_Arcane Shard|r: Morphaz)" },
      },
      { only = "Mage", source = "polestar:forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz",
        { "text", text = "The |cOXP_LOOT_Arcane Shard|r" },
        { "text", text = "Back to Azshara, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sanath Lim-yo|r and the tower. Look at the reward window before you hand in: Classic offered the |cOXP_LOOT_Arcane Crystal Pendant|r, the |cOXP_LOOT_Fire Ruby|r or the |cOXP_LOOT_Glacial Spike|r, and Forever's notes say the choice may be gone." },
        { "goto", x = 29.25, y = 40.21, zone = "1447" },
        { "turnin", quest = 8253, text = "Turn in Destroy Morphaz" },
        { "target", name = "Archmage Xylem" },
      },
      { only = "Priest", source = "polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz", when = { { "zone", name = "Ironforge" }, { "onquest", neg = true, quests = { 8254 } } },
        { "text", text = "Class quest: {quest:8257}" },
        { "text", text = "Cenarion Aid: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priest Rohan|r" },
        { "text", text = "At 50 in Ironforge, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priest Rohan|r in the |cOXP_PICK_Hall of Mysteries|r (|cOXP_PICK_Mystic Ward|r) offers Cenarion Aid. Before you leave a city, buy an |cOXP_LOOT_Ichor of Undeath|r at the Auction House (a few silver): the third quest asks for one and it drops rarely." },
        { "xp", level = 50, text = "Reach level 50" },
        { "goto", x = 24.73, y = 8.16, zone = "1455" },
        { "accept", quest = 8254, text = "Accept Cenarion Aid" },
        { "target", name = "High Priest Rohan" },
      },
      { only = "Priest", source = "polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz", when = { { "onquest", neg = true, quests = { 8254 } } },
        { "text", text = "Cenarion Aid: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Brother Joshua|r" },
        { "text", text = "At 50, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Brother Joshua|r at the altar of Stormwind's Cathedral of Light offers Cenarion Aid (|cOXP_FRIENDLY_High Priest Rohan|r in Ironforge has it too). Before you leave, buy an |cOXP_LOOT_Ichor of Undeath|r at the Auction House in the |cOXP_PICK_Trade District|r (a few silver): the third quest asks for one and it drops rarely." },
        { "xp", level = 50, text = "Reach level 50" },
        { "goto", x = 49.5, y = 45.21, zone = "1453" },
        { "accept", quest = 8254, text = "Accept Cenarion Aid" },
        { "target", name = "Brother Joshua" },
      },
      { only = "Priest", source = "polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz",
        { "text", text = "Cenarion Aid: |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ur'kyo|r" },
        { "text", text = "At 50, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ur'kyo|r in Orgrimmar's |cOXP_PICK_Valley of Spirits|r offers Cenarion Aid. Before you leave, buy an |cOXP_LOOT_Ichor of Undeath|r at the Auction House (a few silver): the third quest asks for one and it drops rarely." },
        { "xp", level = 50, text = "Reach level 50" },
        { "goto", x = 35.59, y = 87.82, zone = "1454" },
        { "accept", quest = 8254, text = "Accept Cenarion Aid" },
        { "target", name = "Ur'kyo" },
      },
      { only = "Priest", source = "polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ogtinc|r" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ogtinc|r, a furbolg, lives on the clifftop north-east of the Ruins of Eldarath. Alliance: fly to Talrendis Point; Horde: fly to Valormok. Ride east and leave the road at the fork before the ruins, then follow the northern cliff edge east to him: the naga ruins and the beach below are walled in by cliffs with no way up." },
        { "goto", x = 11.9, y = 77.59, zone = "1447" },
        { "fp", name = "Talrendis Point", text = "Get the Talrendis Point flight path" },
        { "target", name = "Jarrodenus" },
        { "goto", x = 21.96, y = 49.62, zone = "1447" },
        { "fp", name = "Valormok", text = "Get the Valormok flight path" },
        { "target", name = "Kroum" },
        { "goto", x = 42.4, y = 42.62, zone = "1447" },
        { "turnin", quest = 8254, text = "Turn in Cenarion Aid" },
        { "target", name = "Ogtinc" },
        { "goto", x = 42.4, y = 42.62, zone = "1447" },
        { "accept", quest = 8255, text = "Accept Of Coursers We Know" },
        { "target", name = "Ogtinc" },
      },
      { only = "Priest", source = "polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz",
        { "text", text = "Of Coursers We Know" },
        { "text", text = "Mosshoof Coursers (level 52-53, not elite) graze all over Azshara, thickest north-east of |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ogtinc|r and south of the mountains; about one in three drops a |cOXP_LOOT_Healthy Courser Gland|r, so plan on a dozen kills for four. They enrage at 30% health: finish them fast. Killing them costs no Cenarion Circle reputation. Keep any |cOXP_LOOT_Ichor of Undeath|r you loot." },
        { "goto", x = 52.1, y = 35.39, zone = "1447" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 8255, text = "Healthy Courser Gland: 4" },
        { "mob", name = "Mosshoof Courser" },
      },
      { only = "Priest", source = "polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ogtinc|r" },
        { "goto", x = 42.4, y = 42.62, zone = "1447" },
        { "turnin", quest = 8255, text = "Turn in Of Coursers We Know" },
        { "target", name = "Ogtinc" },
        { "goto", x = 42.4, y = 42.62, zone = "1447" },
        { "accept", quest = 8256, text = "Accept The Ichor of Undeath" },
        { "target", name = "Ogtinc" },
      },
      { only = "Priest", source = "polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz",
        { "text", text = "The Ichor of Undeath" },
        { "text", text = "Carrying an |cOXP_LOOT_Ichor of Undeath|r already? It counts at once. Otherwise any undead may drop one, rarely: the |cOXP_ENEMY_Lingering Highborne|r (level 48) in the Ruins of Eldarath below |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ogtinc|r's cliff drop it about one kill in ten, the highborne ghosts on Azshara's border with Ashenvale (level 45-46) a little less, the Anguished and |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Suffering Highborne|r in Winterspring (54-55) about one in eight. The Auction House is usually quicker." },
        { "goto", x = 40.28, y = 46.13, zone = "1447" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 8256, text = "Ichor of Undeath: 1" },
        { "mob", name = "Lingering Highborne" },
        { "mob", name = "Highborne Apparition" },
        { "mob", name = "Highborne Lichling" },
      },
      { only = "Priest", source = "polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ogtinc|r" },
        { "goto", x = 42.4, y = 42.62, zone = "1447" },
        { "turnin", quest = 8256, text = "Turn in The Ichor of Undeath" },
        { "target", name = "Ogtinc" },
        { "goto", x = 42.4, y = 42.62, zone = "1447" },
        { "accept", quest = 8257, text = "Accept Blood of Morphaz" },
        { "target", name = "Ogtinc" },
      },
      { only = "Priest", source = "polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz",
        { "text", text = "Morphaz in the Sunken Temple" },
        { "text", text = "Morphaz is a level 52 elite green dragon inside the Sunken Temple, a five-player dungeon: bring a group of five (a level 60 group clears it with ease). Horde: fly to Stonard; Alliance: fly to Nethergarde Keep in the Blasted Lands and ride north. The temple stands in the middle of the Pool of Tears: climb the steps on its south side, swim down through the flooded hall and take the stairs to the portal. Inside, Morphaz only appears late: kill the six troll minibosses on the upper balconies, then |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Jammal'an the Prophet|r below them; that wakes the drakes Weaver and Dreamscythe in the Pit of Sacrifice, and killing both brings Morphaz and Hazzas. The pair patrols together and cannot be split: pull them into a hallway and have the tank face them away from the group (breath and a knockback). Loot him in a party, not a raid group: the blood always drops." },
        { "goto", x = 69, y = 54, zone = "1435" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 8257, text = "Blood of Morphaz: 1 (Blood of Morphaz: the Sunken Temple entrance)" },
      },
      { only = "Priest", source = "polestar:forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Greta Mosshoof|r" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Greta Mosshoof|r is at the Emerald Sanctuary in southern Felwood. Horde: fly to Bloodvenom Post and ride south-east; Alliance: fly to Astranaar in Ashenvale and ride north into Felwood. She takes the blood for experience and gold. Look at the reward window before you hand in: Classic let you pick |cOXP_LOOT_Blessed Prayer Beads|r, |cOXP_LOOT_Circle of Hope|r or Woestave, and Forever's notes say that choice may be gone." },
        { "goto", x = 51.21, y = 82.11, zone = "1448" },
        { "turnin", quest = 8257, text = "Turn in Blood of Morphaz" },
        { "target", name = "Greta Mosshoof" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key",
        { "text", text = "Class quest: {quest:8236}" },
        { "text", text = "A Simple Request (Alliance)" },
        { "text", text = "At 50 |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Osborne the Night Man|r in Stormwind's |cOXP_PICK_Old Town|r has it; so do Syurna in Darnassus and |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Hulfdan Blackbeard|r in Ironforge." },
        { "xp", level = 50, text = "Reach level 50" },
        { "goto", x = 77.43, y = 65.31, zone = "1453" },
        { "accept", quest = 8233, text = "Accept A Simple Request" },
        { "target", name = "Osborne the Night Man" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key",
        { "text", text = "A Simple Request (Horde)" },
        { "text", text = "At 50 |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Ormok|r in the |cOXP_PICK_Cleft of Shadow|r has it; so does |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Miles Dexter|r in the Undercity's |cOXP_PICK_Rogues' Quarter|r." },
        { "xp", level = 50, text = "Reach level 50" },
        { "goto", x = 43.9, y = 54.63, zone = "1454" },
        { "accept", quest = 8233, text = "Accept A Simple Request" },
        { "target", name = "Ormok" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Lord Jorach Ravenholdt|r" },
        { "text", text = "Ravenholdt Manor hides in the hills east of Tarren Mill. Horde fly to Tarren Mill, Alliance to Southshore. The trail starts behind the plateau north of Durnholde Keep, climbs into the hills and runs through a small tunnel into the Alterac Mountains; Lord Jorach is inside the manor. Do not attack anyone at the manor: lost Ravenholdt reputation makes him refuse to speak to you." },
        { "goto", x = 86.02, y = 78.88, zone = "1416" },
        { "turnin", quest = 8233, text = "Turn in A Simple Request" },
        { "target", name = "Lord Jorach Ravenholdt" },
        { "goto", x = 86.02, y = 78.88, zone = "1416" },
        { "accept", quest = 8234, text = "Accept Sealed Azure Bag" },
        { "target", name = "Lord Jorach Ravenholdt" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key",
        { "text", text = "Sealed Azure Bag" },
        { "text", text = "Alliance fly to Talrendis Point, Horde to Valormok. Only the level 50-51 Timbermaw Shamans in the furbolg hills of northern Azshara carry the bag (the level 47-49 furbolgs further south do not): about one kill in thirty drops it. Pick Pocket them instead and you lose no Timbermaw reputation; if you are Unfriendly or better with Timbermaw Hold, mark them At War in your reputation panel first. They cast Lightning Bolt and Lightning Cloud, heal each other and run at low health." },
        { "goto", x = 11.9, y = 77.59, zone = "1447" },
        { "fp", name = "Talrendis Point", text = "Get the Talrendis Point flight path" },
        { "target", name = "Jarrodenus" },
        { "goto", x = 21.96, y = 49.62, zone = "1447" },
        { "fp", name = "Valormok", text = "Get the Valormok flight path" },
        { "target", name = "Kroum" },
        { "goto", x = 44.2, y = 26.6, zone = "1447" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 8234, text = "Sealed Azure Bag: 1 (Sealed Azure Bag: |cOXP_ENEMY_Timbermaw Shaman|r)" },
        { "mob", name = "Timbermaw Shaman" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Archmage Xylem|r" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sanath Lim-yo|r, camped below the cliffs just east of Valormok, teleports you up (dismount first); a trail leads to Xylem's tower." },
        { "goto", x = 29.25, y = 40.21, zone = "1447" },
        { "turnin", quest = 8234, text = "Turn in Sealed Azure Bag" },
        { "target", name = "Archmage Xylem" },
        { "goto", x = 29.25, y = 40.21, zone = "1447" },
        { "accept", quest = 8235, text = "Accept Encoded Fragments" },
        { "target", name = "Archmage Xylem" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key",
        { "text", text = "Encoded Fragments" },
        { "text", text = "The Forest Oozes (level 52-53, Diseased Slime up close) drop a fragment four times in five: the biggest group, seven of them, is in the Bitter Reaches hills of north-eastern Azshara, four more south-east of Valormok. Pick their pockets before the kill for an extra fragment or two. Killing the Mistwing Ravagers and hippogryphs that share their spots makes more oozes appear." },
        { "goto", x = 36.16, y = 67.86, zone = "1447" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 8235, text = "Encoded Fragment: 10 (|cOXP_LOOT_Encoded Fragment|r: |cOXP_ENEMY_Forest Ooze|r)" },
        { "mob", name = "Forest Ooze" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key",
        { "text", text = "Back to Xylem" },
        { "goto", x = 29.25, y = 40.21, zone = "1447" },
        { "turnin", quest = 8235, text = "Turn in Encoded Fragments" },
        { "target", name = "Archmage Xylem" },
        { "goto", x = 29.25, y = 40.21, zone = "1447" },
        { "accept", quest = 8236, text = "Accept The Azure Key" },
        { "target", name = "Archmage Xylem" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key",
        { "text", text = "Morphaz in the Sunken Temple" },
        { "text", text = "Morphaz, a level 52 elite green drake, lives deep in the Sunken Temple: a group of five, level 50-54. The temple stands in the Pool of Tears; climb into the sunken building, swim down through it and follow the passage to the portal. Horde: fly to Stonard; Alliance: fly to Nethergarde Keep and ride on. He is not there when you arrive: first kill the six troll guardians (elites of 50-52) on the platforms around the upper ring, which opens the way down (the left-hand ramp from the entrance) to |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Jammal'an the Prophet|r in the Pit of Sacrifice. Jammal'an's death brings out two drakes, Weaver and Dreamscythe; when both are dead, Morphaz and Hazzas appear together and fight as a pair. Their Acid Breath is nature damage: nature protection potions help; poisons and Blind do not work on them. The key always drops. Hunters, Priests and Mages of 50 need Morphaz too: one clear serves them all." },
        { "goto", x = 69.9, y = 53.6, zone = "1435" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 8236, text = "Azure Key: 1 (|cOXP_LOOT_Azure Key|r: Morphaz, inside the temple)" },
      },
      { only = "Rogue", source = "polestar:forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key",
        { "text", text = "Lord Ravenholdt" },
        { "text", text = "Look at the reward window before you hand in: Classic offered the |cOXP_LOOT_Duskbat Drape|r, the |cOXP_LOOT_Ebon Mask|r or the |cOXP_LOOT_Whisperwalk Boots|r, and Forever's notes say the choice may be gone." },
        { "goto", x = 86.02, y = 78.88, zone = "1416" },
        { "turnin", quest = 8236, text = "Turn in The Azure Key" },
        { "target", name = "Lord Jorach Ravenholdt" },
      },
      { only = "Orc Shaman/Troll Shaman", source = "polestar:forever/class/shaman/spirit-totem",
        { "text", text = "Class quest: {quest:8412} and {quest:8413}" },
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sagorne Creststrider|r" },
        { "text", text = "At 50 |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Sagorne Creststrider|r, the shaman trainer in the |cOXP_PICK_Valley of Wisdom|r, asks for the four elements for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Bath'rah the Windwatcher|r." },
        { "xp", level = 50, text = "Reach level 50" },
        { "goto", x = 38.66, y = 35.92, zone = "1454" },
        { "accept", quest = 8410, text = "Accept Elemental Mastery" },
        { "target", name = "Sagorne Creststrider" },
      },
      { only = "Tauren Shaman/Skyborne Shaman", source = "polestar:forever/class/shaman/spirit-totem",
        { "text", text = "|cOXP_FRIENDLY_Beram Skychaser|r" },
        { "text", text = "At 50 |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Beram Skychaser|r, a shaman trainer on Spirit Rise in Thunder Bluff, asks for the four elements for |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Bath'rah the Windwatcher|r. Skyborne: Forever's quest page lists Elemental Mastery and Spirit Totem for Orcs, Tauren and Trolls only; if |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Beram Skychaser|r has nothing for you, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Bath'rah the Windwatcher|r's own Mastering the Elements is open to every Horde race, but Spirit Totem after it may still turn you away." },
        { "xp", level = 50, text = "Reach level 50" },
        { "goto", x = 21.99, y = 18.8, zone = "1456" },
        { "accept", quest = 8410, text = "Accept Elemental Mastery" },
        { "target", name = "Beram Skychaser" },
      },
      { only = "Shaman", source = "polestar:forever/class/shaman/spirit-totem",
        { "text", text = "The four elements" },
        { "text", text = "One each of |cOXP_LOOT_Elemental Air|r, Fire, Earth and Water; all four trade, so the auction house is quickest. To farm them, Arathi Highlands has the exiles near Refuge Pointe (level 38-39, about one kill in eight to ten, respawn under seven minutes): Thundering Exiles south-east of it (air), Rumbling Exiles south-west (earth), Burning Exiles far to the north-west (fire), and the |cOXP_ENEMY_Summoned Guardian|r far to the south-west (water, about one in seven). Water comes easier from the Patches of Elemental Water in Azshara (two in five) or |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Seeker Aqualon|r by Lakeshire in Redridge." },
        { "goto", x = 51.89, y = 50.62, zone = "1417" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 8410, text = "Elemental Air: 1 (|cOXP_LOOT_Elemental Air|r: Thundering Exiles)" },
        { "mob", name = "Thundering Exile" },
        { "goto", x = 27.43, y = 31.39, zone = "1417" },
