      { only = "Shaman", source = "polestar:forever/class/shaman/spirit-totem",
        { "text", text = "Spider eye and bear claw" },
        { "text", text = "Eight of each. Fly or ride to the Bulwark and on to the west edge of the Western Plaguelands, north-west of Chillwind Camp: the Venom Mist Lurkers (level 50-51, they poison) give the |cOXP_LOOT_Bloodshot Spider Eye|r and the Diseased Black Bears (level 51-52, Infected Wound) the |cOXP_LOOT_Thick Black Claw|r, one kill in five each; the two Carrion Vultures there drop either. The bigger Diseased Grizzlies and Plague Lurkers further east almost never drop them. A few bears and lurkers also roam south-east of Brill in Tirisfal." },
        { "goto", x = 31.08, y = 58.54, zone = "1422" },
        { "complete", obj = 1, quest = 8412, text = "Bloodshot Spider Eye: 8" },
        { "mob", name = "Carrion Vulture" },
        { "mob", name = "Venom Mist Lurker" },
        { "goto", x = 31.28, y = 60.13, zone = "1422" },
