        { "text", text = "A Troubled Spirit (Ironforge)" },
        { "text", text = "At 50, |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Kelv Sternhammer|r, the warrior trainer of Ironforge, sends you to the |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Fallen Hero of the Horde|r in the Swamp of Sorrows." },
