        { "text", text = "The |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Fallen Hero of the Horde|r, a ghost, stands in the south-west of the Swamp of Sorrows, at the pass into the Blasted Lands, a short ride south-west of Stonard. Horde: fly to Stonard. Alliance: fly to Nethergarde Keep in the Blasted Lands and ride north through the pass. High-level beasts roam the way." },
