      { only = "Warrior", source = "polestar:forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers",
        { "text", text = "The Sunken Temple" },
        { "text", text = "You need two feathers of each colour from the six Atal'ai troll guardians (level 51-52, elite) on the Sunken Temple's balcony, who hold the barrier in front of |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Jammal'an the Prophet|r: Gasher and |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Zul'Lor|r drop the amber, Hukku and Mijan the blue, Zolo and Loro the green, every kill; each player on the quest loots their own set. The Sunken Temple is a five-player dungeon: needs a group of five. It lies in the Pool of Tears in eastern Swamp of Sorrows: climb the temple's outer steps, dive into the flooded hall and follow the stairs down to the entrance. Inside, reach the balcony by the stairs or the path on the right, not the spiral stairs. Hukku calls guardians and casts Shadow Bolt Volley and Curse of Blood; Mijan heals the others (Renew, a |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Healing Ward|r, Healing Wave below half health): kill her or her ward fast; |cOXP_FRIENDLY_Zul'Lor|r cleaves." },
